# Shell scripts must always check out as LF. core.autocrlf=true (a per-developer
# Windows setting) would otherwise convert them to CRLF, which corrupts the
# multi-line JSON string literals embedded in openspec/changes/api-key-data-migration/batches/*.sh.
# Scoped to *.sh only -- does not affect any other file type or anyone's global git config.
*.sh text eol=lf
